  "historyNote": "#721.19, eff 12-7-75; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90, EXPIRED: 12-27-96 New. #7672, eff 4-5-02; amd by #8876, eff 4-27-07; amd by #9489, eff 6-23-09; ss by #9643, eff 1-23-10; amd by #10076, eff 1-25-12; amd by #10980, eff 11-20-15; ss by #12387, eff 9-22-17; ss by #13209, eff 5-25-21; ss by #13381, eff 5-25-22; ss by #14118, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34",
